+## Part 3 data notes
+
+The menu data follows the supplied Cafe Big Mo's menu artwork. Product descriptions are intentionally not invented because the source menu does not provide them. Free delivery is configured for order values above ₹299. The delivery charge at or below that threshold remains `null` until the cafe supplies the amount. The supplied 4.7 Google Maps rating is stored as a reported value that must be live-verified before public display.
+
 ## Part 2 visual verification
 
 Run `npm run dev`, then check `/` plus `/menu`, `/about`, `/gallery`, `/outlets`, `/contact` and `/bag` at desktop and mobile widths. The header, mobile drawer, footer and fixed mobile ordering bar should remain consistent across routes.
